花びら舞い散る 記憶舞い戻る
Cherry petals dancing, memories returning...

111
00:17:20,026 --> 00:17:27,346
気付けばまたこの季節で 君との想い出に誘われ
Before I noticed, in this season again, drawn into memories of you...

112
