レンズ越し未来にめがけて ピースサイン伝えてる今んとこ いい調子
Aiming toward the future through the lens, flashing a peace sign—things are going well so far.

138
00:22:17,073 --> 00:22:25,473
青春の1ページも たった1ページで 自慢の人生のハイライトも
Even a page of youth is just a single page, and the highlight of my proud life...

139
00:22:25,773 --> 00:22:32,273
一夜きりのTweetのbuzzみたい 君と出会った日のことを 覚えてるよ
...is like a one-night-only viral tweet. I remember the day I met you.

140
00:22:32,823 --> 00:22:37,273
イヤフォン垂らして この曲を きいていたよ
With my earphones playing, I was listening to this song.

141
00:22:37,723 --> 00:22:41,673
あれから数えて今日は何年目！？
Counting from back then, how many years has it been today?!

142
00:22:42,173 --> 00:22:47,173
今じゃ足跡 どこも残るから これは歌詞カード
Now footprints are left everywhere, so this is the lyric card.

143
00:22:47,273 --> 00:22:53,523
載せず鍵かけておこう ほらね、聴き取れない！！
I'll keep it locked up without posting it—see, you can't make it out!

144
00:22:53,973 --> 00:23:06,273
人はいつもくよくよ悩み 締め切りに追われ歴史を作り 弱さを無理やり ごまかし 君の芝生は緑 青じゃなくていい
Everyone is always constantly worrying, chased by deadlines making history, forcibly covering up their weakness. Your lawn is green, it doesn't have to be blue.

145
00:23:06,673 --> 00:23:12,273
アイドル撮られちゃった真冬の空に 政治家ぶれてブレちゃった帰り道
An idol caught on camera in the midwinter sky, a politician swaying and faltering on the way home.

146
00:23:12,723 --> 00:23:18,573
とうちゃんローン組んだ みはてぬ先 でも時は全部を流して
Even at the far end of Dad taking out a mortgage, time washes everything away.

147
00:23:19,073 --> 00:23:24,273
人はこれって時 どうしても 「時間を戻せたら」とかいうね
People always say things like "If I could turn back time..." at moments like that.

148
