見て見ぬフリ No, No
Pretending not to see, No, No

173
00:26:46,069 --> 00:26:54,789
夢追い笑われ 傷だらけでギラつく My way Go on! You should know who we are Forever Young
Chasing dreams, being laughed at, glittering covered in scars, my way! Go on! You should know who we are, Forever Young

174
00:26:57,309 --> 00:27:02,009
大切なことは魂の状態
What's important is the state of the soul

175
00:27:02,249 --> 00:27:08,949
Forever Young Hey！ It's your turn next time from here 「あの日始めれば良かった」
Forever Young Hey! It's your turn next time from here, 'I should've started that day'

176
00:27:09,229 --> 00:27:13,509
その次の始めるべき時は今
The time to start the next one is now

177
00:27:14,349 --> 00:27:18,029
高笑いする都会の喧騒 ウケ狙いならば振り向けれんぞ
