192
00:28:38,009 --> 00:28:41,629
まだ終わらない 終わらせやしない 燃え尽きるまで
It's not over yet, I won't let it end, until I burn out

193
00:28:44,389 --> 00:28:48,949
くたばるまで Forever Young
Until we drop, Forever Young

194
00:28:49,189 --> 00:28:57,229
Forever Young もう夢を追いかけ本気になった心は 自分の指図も受けない
Forever Young Once you chase dreams and your heart gets serious, it won't even take orders from yourself

195
00:28:59,509 --> 00:29:08,689
Hey！ その思いから逃れられないなら 自ら向かうだけ
Hey! If you can't escape from that feeling, just head toward it yourself

196
00:29:08,949 --> 00:29:12,749
終わらせやしない 燃え尽きるまで
I won't let it end, until I burn out

197
00:29:13,349 --> 00:29:17,009
まだ終わらない 終わらせやしない くたばるまで
It's not over yet, I won't let it end, until we drop

198
00:29:17,389 --> 00:29:21,949
まだ終わらない Forever Young
It's not over yet, Forever Young

199
00:29:22,209 --> 00:29:27,909
そう 今日という日は お前に残された人生の一番若い日
Yes, today is the youngest day of the life left to you

200
00:29:43,309 --> 00:29:48,449
いやマジこのForever Youngって曲をマリンと一緒に歌いたかったの
Man, seriously, I wanted to sing this song 'Forever Young' together with Marine!

201
00:29:48,449 --> 00:29:51,169
Forever Youngって曲をね
That song 'Forever Young', you know.

202
00:29:51,289 --> 00:29:54,749
そう もうおばさんにならないように
Yeah, so we don't turn into old hags—

203
00:29:54,749 --> 00:29:55,909
そうそうそう！
That's right, that's right!

204
00:29:56,069 --> 00:30:01,489
そうだよえいえんにねYoungでさ みんなみんなForever Youngで行こうね
That's right, eternally young, everyone let's stay Forever Young!

205
00:32:58,714 --> 00:33:01,714
[Title: のびしろ]
[Title: Nobishiro]

206
00:33:08,114 --> 00:33:12,714
サボり方とか 甘え方とか 逃げ方とか 言い訳のし方とか
Knowing how to slack off, how to play spoiled, how to run away, how to make excuses...

207
00:33:13,714 --> 00:33:18,714
やっと覚えて来た 身につけて来た 柔らかい頭
I've finally learned and acquired a flexible mind.

208
00:33:19,214 --> 00:33:24,214
カッコのつけ方 調子のこき方 腹の据え方 良い年のこき方
