00:35:09,727 --> 00:35:15,567
幸せの体感速度は早くなるばかり
The perceived speed of happiness only keeps getting faster

235
00:35:15,567 --> 00:35:20,947
傷が癒えていく速度は遅くなるばかり
The speed at which wounds heal only keeps getting slower

236
00:35:20,947 --> 00:35:25,527
他人に期待をしないのが今の俺の強み
Not expecting anything from others is my strength now

237
00:35:25,527 --> 00:35:30,767
手負いでも進める距離なら行くぜ騙し騙し
If it's a distance I can go even while wounded, I'll push through by hook or by crook

238
00:35:30,767 --> 00:35:34,647
身の程を知るほどに 胸を張り
The more I know my place, the more I puff out my chest

239
00:35:34,647 --> 00:35:42,247
でも時にしたって良い背伸び やっと「大人気ない」が出来る年
Always as usual, but sometimes stretching myself is fine, an age where I can finally act childish

240
00:35:42,247 --> 00:35:47,327
小さな枠組み ただの数字 縛られずにでも腹くくり
Small frameworks, just numbers, unconstrained yet resolute

241
00:35:47,327 --> 00:35:58,687
あの日の俺が立ち止まる ほどにデカくそびえ立つ 隅田川にかかる 勝鬨橋を渡る
Towering so large that the me of that day stops in my tracks, crossing Kachidoki Bridge over the Sumida River

242
00:35:58,687 --> 00:36:04,727
重なるスカイツリー 東京タワーと真ん中の頼りない背中
Overlapping Skytree, Tokyo Tower, and my unreliable back right in the middle

243
00:36:04,727 --> 00:36:15,567
サボり方とか 甘え方とか 逃げ方とか 言い訳のし方とか やっと覚えて来た 身につけて来た 柔らかい頭
Finally learning how to slack off, how to be coddled, how to run away, how to make excuses, with a flexible mind I've acquired

244
00:36:15,567 --> 00:36:18,047
カッコのつけ方 調子のこき方
How to act cool, how to get carried away

245
00:36:18,047 --> 00:36:21,787
腹の据え方 良い年のこき方
How to steel your resolve, how to age gracefully

246
00:36:21,787 --> 00:36:26,967
脂乗りに乗った 濁った目した だらしない身体
Peak in my prime, cloudy-eyed, sloppy body

247
00:36:26,967 --> 00:36:33,787
嫌われ方や 慕われ方や 叱り方とか 綺麗なぶつかり方
How to be disliked, how to be admired, how to scold, how to clash cleanly

248
00:36:33,787 --> 00:36:36,827
覚えたい事が山のようにある...
There are mountains of things I want to learn...

249
00:36:36,827 --> 00:36:49,627
のびしろしか無いわ のびしろしか無いわ のびしろしか無いわ 俺らまだのびしろしかないわ
There's nothing but room to grow, nothing but room to grow, we still have endless room to grow!

250
00:36:55,091 --> 00:36:57,711
くだんない話と
Silly talk and

251
00:36:57,711 --> 00:37:01,091
うざったい貴様と
You annoying bastard and

252
00:37:01,091 --> 00:37:04,651
なみなみの日々に 注がれてく
