253
00:37:04,651 --> 00:37:08,991
怠いが溢れ出してく 飯がまだ届かない
Lethargy overflows, the food still hasn't arrived

254
00:37:08,991 --> 00:37:12,391
仕事は片付かない
Work won't get finished

255
00:37:12,391 --> 00:37:17,491
うだつの上がらない 毎日にため息ばかり
Just sighing every day with nothing to show for it

256
00:37:17,491 --> 00:37:19,831
でまたド派手にすっころび
Then falling flat on my face in style again

257
00:37:19,831 --> 00:37:22,931
洗い立てのシャツにこぼすコーヒー
Spilling coffee on a freshly washed shirt

258
00:37:22,931 --> 00:37:26,891
前のめりその姿勢だけは褒めて良し
At least praise that eager posture of mine

259
00:37:26,891 --> 00:37:30,351
肩落とす並木通り 増えた柄と差し色に
Shoulders dropping on the tree-lined street, with increased patterns and accent colors

260
00:37:30,351 --> 00:37:37,751
嗚呼 本当嫌んなる毎日だ やりたくないことやったって
Ah... what a truly miserable daily grind, even when doing things I don't want to do

261
00:37:37,751 --> 00:37:43,011
嫌々早起きしたって その分素敵な何かが
No matter how unwillingly I wake up early, is some wonderful thing

262
00:37:43,011 --> 00:37:45,291
訪れるとかそんなわけでもないのにさ
Going to happen or anything like that, but still

263
00:37:45,291 --> 00:37:52,071
今日もまた頑張っちゃうよな がむしゃら以外知らないから 不器用で意地っ張りで 馬鹿真面目な僕らに幸あれ
I'll do my best again today because I only know how to go all out. Blessings to us clumsy, stubborn, and dead-serious fools!

264
00:37:52,071 --> 00:37:56,191
重くなってきた荷物をちょっと置いて立ち止まり
Putting down my heavy luggage for a moment to stop

265
00:37:56,191 --> 00:38:03,531
昨日の事なんざ忘れちまえば同じ 浴びるDay light 羽根伸ばし それか月夜にこっそりと吐き出してしまえば良い
Forgetting yesterday's troubles makes it all the same, basking in daylight, spreading my wings, or secretly venting it out to the moonlit night

266
00:38:03,531 --> 00:38:06,731
でもその前にアレとコレの話
